#### String Pool Management
```java
// Managing string pool memory
public class StringPoolManager {
    // Avoid excessive string interning
    public String processUserInput(String input) {
        // Don't intern user input strings
        if (isValidConstant(input)) {
            return input.intern();  // Only intern known constants
        }
        return input;
    }
    
    // Use string caching for frequently used values
    private final Map<String, String> frequentStrings = new HashMap<>();
    
    public String getCachedString(String value) {
        return frequentStrings.computeIfAbsent(value, k -> k);
    }
}
