### 7. WoS Bot Specific Memory Patterns

#### Screenshot and Image Caching
```java
// Screenshot caching per emulator (in Emulator class)
private final ConcurrentHashMap<String, DTORawImage> lastScreenshotCache = 
    new ConcurrentHashMap<>();

public DTORawImage captureScreenshot(String emulatorNumber) {
    // Check cache first
    DTORawImage cached = lastScreenshotCache.get(emulatorNumber);
    if (cached != null && isCacheValid(cached)) {
        return cached;
    }
    
    // Capture new screenshot
    DTORawImage screenshot = performCapture(emulatorNumber);
    
    // Update cache (limit cache size to prevent memory growth)
    if (lastScreenshotCache.size() > MAX_CACHED_SCREENSHOTS) {
        evictOldestScreenshot();
    }
    lastScreenshotCache.put(emulatorNumber, screenshot);
    
    return screenshot;
}

// Limit cache size to prevent unbounded growth
private static final int MAX_CACHED_SCREENSHOTS = 10;
```

